{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "a3-monitoring",
    "name": "backend-performance"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "后端请求性能",
      "description": "统一核心图表；来源特有指标列于专属诊断。单位见标题，统计差异见图表提示。\n\nA3 引擎采集范围\nPrefill：4 个引擎（7100–7103）；Decode：16 个引擎（7100–7115）。Decode 为 8 张物理卡、每卡 2 个芯片设备，DP=16 / TP=1。2026-09-28 修复前仅采集 Decode 前 4 个端点；已确认 DP=16 漏采期间的历史保留，但不代表全量，不能乘倍数补算或直接作为完整性能基线。更早拓扑未经核实，不推定漏采。精确修复时间见监控 API 的 collection_coverage.repair_complete_at。 本次完整采集确认时间：2026-09-28T14:19:30+08:00。"
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "role",
          "display": {
            "name": "角色"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "(prefill|a3-1)",
                  "label": "Prefill"
                },
                {
                  "value": "(decode|a3-2)",
                  "label": "Decode"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "core-requests": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "后端请求速率（请求/秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧已完成请求计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。完成包含源指标记录的各结束原因，不等于成功量；同一请求可能经过 P/D 两侧，不应把两侧直接相加当作去重请求数。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_requests_per_second{environment=\"a3-vllm\",role=~\"$role\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-output": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "后端输出 Token 吞吐（Token/秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧 Token 计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。Token 是分词器单位，不等同于字符数或请求数；不同模型或输入输出组成的吞吐不宜直接比较。输出 Token 与 Decode Token 遵循各自源指标，源无效时留空。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_decode_tokens_per_second{environment=\"a3-vllm\",role=~\"$role\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-ttft": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "首 Token 延迟 TTFT（秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧从请求开始到首 Token 的时延。它不等于客户端看到首字符的完整网络时延，也不同于当前仍在等待请求的最大年龄。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "label_map((last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_latency_seconds{environment=\"a3-vllm\",role=~\"$role\",kind=\"ttft\"}[5s])), \"quantile\", \"0.5\", \"P50\", \"0.95\", \"P95\", \"0.99\", \"P99\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · {{quantile}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-itl": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Token 间延迟 ITL（ms）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧相邻输出 Token 间隔的时延分布。它不是整个回答的生成时间；与按整段输出均摊的 TPOT 也可能不同。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "label_map((last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_latency_seconds{environment=\"a3-vllm\",role=~\"$role\",kind=\"itl\"}[5s])), \"quantile\", \"0.5\", \"P50\", \"0.95\", \"P95\", \"0.99\", \"P99\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · {{quantile}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-e2e": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "端到端延迟 E2E（秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧请求从开始到结束的总时延。不同输入/输出长度、缓存状态和并发负载会改变分布；不能把不同阶段的 P95 相减来求网关开销。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "label_map((last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_latency_seconds{environment=\"a3-vllm\",role=~\"$role\",kind=\"e2e\"}[5s])), \"quantile\", \"0.5\", \"P50\", \"0.95\", \"P95\", \"0.99\", \"P99\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · {{quantile}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "extra-request_inference_time_seconds": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Inference 时延（秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n后端原生请求直方图，包含源记录的全部请求。TPOT 是每请求输出 Token 平均耗时，与 ITL 分布含义不同。各阶段分位数不可直接相加。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "label_map((last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_diagnostic_quantile{environment=\"a3-vllm\",diagnostic=\"extra-request_inference_time_seconds\",node=~\"$role\"}[5s])), \"quantile\", \"0.5\", \"P50\", \"0.95\", \"P95\", \"0.99\", \"P99\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} · 引擎{{engine}} DP{{dp_rank}} TP{{tp_rank}} PP{{pp_rank}} · {{stage}} {{cache_type}} · {{quantile}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "extra-request_time_per_output_token_seconds": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "每请求 TPOT（ms）",
            "description": "指标含义\n后端原生请求直方图，包含源记录的全部请求。TPOT 是每请求输出 Token 平均耗时，与 ITL 分布含义不同。各阶段分位数不可直接相加。\n\n速率和分位数采用固定 1 分钟窗口，原生 gauge 保持当前值；每 5 秒记录；计数器重置采用原生处理。按可用来源汇总，缺采或质量异常请同时查看覆盖与质量图表。新记录启用前及记录缺口留空。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "label_map((last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_diagnostic_quantile{environment=\"a3-vllm\",diagnostic=\"extra-request_time_per_output_token_seconds\",node=~\"$role\"}[5s])), \"quantile\", \"0.5\", \"P50\", \"0.95\", \"P95\", \"0.99\", \"P99\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} · 引擎{{engine}} DP{{dp_rank}} TP{{tp_rank}} PP{{pp_rank}} · {{stage}} {{cache_type}} · {{quantile}}",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "native-coverage": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "后端采集覆盖（实例）",
            "description": "可用实例少于配置实例时，吞吐、缓存和延迟为部分来源的统计，不代表全量。up 可用不保证每个指标存在；历史无记录时不显示为零。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_available_instances{environment=\"a3-vllm\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · 可用",
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_backend_expected_instances{environment=\"a3-vllm\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · 配置",
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "native-quality": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "源指标一致性问题（项）",
            "description": "独立展示直方图缺失、+Inf/count 不一致和缓存计数不一致；不遮蔽原生计算结果。零仅表示这些检查未发现问题，不保证逐桶单调性或全部指标完整。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_histogram_quality_issues{environment=\"a3-vllm\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} · {{kind}} {{diagnostic}}",
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "last_over_time(monitoring_native_cache_quality_issues{environment=\"a3-vllm\"}[5s])",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{role}} · 缓存 {{kind}}",
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource",
                      "name": "victoriametrics"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "layouts": [
      {
        "kind": "Grid",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "title": "核心指标"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/core-requests"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/core-output"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/core-ttft"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/core-itl"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 16,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/core-e2e"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "Grid",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "title": "专属诊断",
            "collapse": {
              "open": false
            }
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/extra-request_inference_time_seconds"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/extra-request_time_per_output_token_seconds"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/native-coverage"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/native-quality"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "duration": "1h",
    "refreshInterval": "15s"
  }
}
